  "summary": "preinstall downloads Bun runtime and executes obfuscated payload",
  "details": "The package's preinstall script (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun runtime from GitHub releases (oven-sh/bun v1.3.13) and uses it via execFileSync to run math_init.js, a 727KB heavily obfuscated Bun-bundled sibling file with a rotated string-array decoder (WV8StW / hc1jfK9). The setup.mjs launcher itself uses _0x-style obfuscated identifiers. The advertised purpose is a React route-config library, which has no legitimate need to install a second language runtime at npm install time or to execute an opaque bundled payload. The alternate-runtime execution path evades scanners that only inspect Node-reachable code, and installers run arbitrary opaque code as a side effect of npm install.",
